WEBVTT

00:00:10,420 --> 00:00:14,820
Do you struggle with chronic inflammation and pain from an injury or infection that has

00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:21,460
never fully healed? If so, you know how seriously it affects not just your daily life, work

00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:28,260
in relationships, but also your well-being and self-esteem. In this video, I'll discuss the

00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:34,900
causes of these issues as well as common solutions to them. But before that, allow me to introduce myself.

00:00:35,860 --> 00:00:42,740
My name is Sharon Katsky. I am the founder and president of Vizem Light. I'm also a passionate LED

00:00:42,740 --> 00:00:48,740
light therapist with over 20 years of experience in the field of light therapy. My goal is to

00:00:48,740 --> 00:00:55,140
provide people and animals with the safe, non-invasive, painless method to promote healing

00:00:55,140 --> 00:01:01,060
using the body's own immune system response. Countless medical practitioners,

00:01:01,060 --> 00:01:06,980
chiropractors, veterinarians, and people at home have found tremendous benefits for themselves

00:01:06,980 --> 00:01:13,540
and their patients with the Vizem Light. I'd like to show you how and why this therapy is so remarkably

00:01:13,540 --> 00:01:21,460
effective. But first, what causes chronic inflammation and pain? Inflammation is your body's natural

00:01:21,460 --> 00:01:28,660
immune response to infection, irritation, or injury. For a long or severe inflammation can create a

00:01:28,660 --> 00:01:34,820
chronic systemic response that damages the body at the cellular level causing prolonged pain.

00:01:36,340 --> 00:01:42,020
Untreated infection or injury is another cause of prolonged inflammation and pain as our auto-immune

00:01:42,020 --> 00:01:50,180
disorders and even long-term exposure to irritants. Additionally, lifestyle choices such as smoking,

00:01:50,180 --> 00:01:56,180
diet, alcohol, and even chronic stress are also contributing factors.

00:01:56,820 --> 00:02:01,460
Prolonged inflammation can also lead to other diseases such as rheumatoid arthritis,

00:02:02,260 --> 00:02:11,300
Alzheimer's disease, asthma, and even cancer. This is why average everyday inflammation is best

00:02:11,300 --> 00:02:17,940
kept under control to reduce the risk of chronic inflammation. Typical treatments include non-stereoidal

00:02:17,940 --> 00:02:23,620
anti-inflammatory drugs, or NSAIDs, steroids, and herbal supplements.

00:02:25,060 --> 00:02:30,340
While these treatment options have been proven to reduce inflammation, they usually come with risk.

00:02:30,340 --> 00:02:35,860
Long-term use of anti-inflammatory drugs has been associated with heightened risk of conditions

00:02:35,860 --> 00:02:42,180
like peptic ulcer and kidney disease, and prolonged use of steroids can result in vision problems,

00:02:42,180 --> 00:02:48,420
osteoporosis, or high blood pressure. Even herbal supplements which aren't strictly regulated by

00:02:48,420 --> 00:02:54,740
the FDA can pose health risks, especially if they're taken with other medications. Of course,

00:02:54,740 --> 00:03:03,540
an anti-inflammatory diet that includes fatty fish, olive oil, nuts, tomatoes, leafy greens,

00:03:03,540 --> 00:03:07,540
and fruits is an effective and essential part of your treatment.

00:03:08,180 --> 00:03:14,340
But what if there was another faster, more effective way to manage symptoms of inflammation

00:03:14,340 --> 00:03:20,580
before it gets worse and leads to a more serious illness? That solution is photobiomodulation therapy,

00:03:21,220 --> 00:03:30,740
GBMT, or simply light therapy. It is an effective, pain-free method to reduce chronic inflammation

00:03:30,740 --> 00:03:38,100
and ease acute and chronic pain. While additional research, development, and clinical trials continue

00:03:38,100 --> 00:03:45,940
across a broad spectrum of diseases, conditions, and symptoms, so far there are over 5,500 publications

00:03:45,940 --> 00:03:51,060
approved. This therapy has tremendous promise and far-reaching implications,

00:03:52,020 --> 00:03:57,460
making light therapy an exciting addition to existing therapies. This has led to numerous

00:03:57,460 --> 00:04:02,500
handheld light therapy devices in the market right now. However, most of these provide a single

00:04:02,500 --> 00:04:08,980
color and a single purpose, which severely limits their functionality. As a long-term user of lights

00:04:08,980 --> 00:04:15,940
for healing, I felt there was a need to offer one device at one price that has multiple colors,

00:04:15,940 --> 00:04:23,140
power settings, and functionalities, all of which can be easily operated by anyone. This led me to

00:04:23,140 --> 00:04:29,460
create the vision light. And all in one, user-friendly device that provides comprehensive healing

00:04:29,460 --> 00:04:35,540
benefits and will not become obsolete in a few years, as more information in the field of light therapy

